| Path                                              | Purpose                                                                |
|---------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `redis/gen-certs.sh`                              | Local PKI generator with self-verification.                            |
| `redis/tls/`                                      | Generated cert material (gitignored).                                  |
| `redis/INVESTIGATION.md`                          | Full investigation report (the bug, the fix, the validation campaign). |
